Thank you for reaching out to your American Red Cross to host a blood drive program. &nbsp;We are always looking for new sponsors to engage in our mission. &nbsp;We rely on the generosity of donors and volunteers to help us alleviate human suffering.<br />
Our first step is to determine how many participants your drive will have. I am attaching an Interest Survey for you to &nbsp;gather names and contact information for potential donors. &nbsp;Once we know the appropriate resources to allocate for your blood drive, then we can look at the calendar for dates and times.<br />
<br />
Call me next week with your survey results and we will set up a time to meet for next steps.<br />
<br />
Thanks in advance,<br />
